          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Apply at checkout on <a href="https://masuhome.com/THEMCGENNISFAMILY" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" class="text-mcgennis-gold hover:text-mcgennis-maroon underline">masuhome.com</a> &mdash; works on the chopsticks below and anything else in their shop.</p>
